# Title: VBA DLL Loaded Via Office Application
# ID: e6ce8457-68b1-485b-9bdd-3c2b5d679aa9
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: Antonlovesdnb
# Date: 2020-02-19
# Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1204.002
# Description: Detects VB DLL's loaded by an office application. Which could indicate the presence of VBA Macros.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((process_name:*\\excel.exe OR process_name:*\\mspub.exe OR process_name:*\\onenote.exe OR process_name:*\\onenoteim.exe OR process_name:*\\outlook.exe OR process_name:*\\powerpnt.exe OR process_name:*\\winword.exe) AND (ImageLoaded:*\\VBE7.DLL OR ImageLoaded:*\\VBEUI.DLL OR ImageLoaded:*\\VBE7INTL.DLL))
